 "kind": "answer",
 "message": "Yes, you'll need a doctor's note for this one. Under POL-SICK-01, sick absences longer than 3 consecutive working days need a doctor's note sent to HR. Counting from last Wednesday (11 Nov) through Wednesday 18 Nov, you'll have been out 6 working days, so the note is required.\n\nSick days come from your 10 paid sick days per calendar year, separate from PTO. They don't carry over. Please send the note to HR when you can. Hope you feel better soon.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-SICK-01"
 ]
}
